data: {"id":"tool-result-714e895bed8a8e48","author":"工具结果","role":"assistant","target":"qwen(qwen3.8-flash)","content":"tool_call_id: tool-call-714e895bed8a8e48\ntool_name: edit_file\nroute: runtime-executed\nstatus: completed\nsummary: tool_name: edit_file route: runtime-executed status: ok permission_gate: allow-auto elapsed_ms: 2 input: {\"new_string\":\" // 空格键快捷播放/暂停（与\\\"减少动态\\\"勾选状态保持同步）\\n document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\\n if (e.code === 'Space' && e.target === document.body){\\n e.preventDefault();\\n if (!playing && reduceChk.checked) reduceChk.checked = false;\\n setPlaying(!playing);\\n }\\n });\",\"old_string\":\" // 空格键快捷播放/暂停\\n document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\\n if (e.code === 'Space' && e.target === document.body){ e.preventDefault(); setPlaying(!playing); }\\n });\",\"path\":\"C:\\\\Users\\\\zhupu\\\\Desktop\\\\coolzhuagent\\\\tmp\\\\2026-09-19-qwen\\\\runtime\\\\pelican-bicycle.html\"} summary: edit_file: { \"filePath\": \"\\\\\\\\?\\\\C:\\\\Users\\\\zhupu\\\\Desktop\\\\coolzhuagent\\\\tmp\\\\2026-09-19-qwen\\\\runtime\\\\pelican-bicycle.html\", \"oldString\": \" // 空格键快捷播放/暂停\\n document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\\n if (e.code === 'Space' && e.target === document.body){ e.preventDefault(); setPlaying(!playing); }\\n });\", \" output: { \"filePath\": \"\\\\\\\\?\\\\C:\\\\Users\\\\zhupu\\\\Desktop\\\\coolzhuagent\\\\tmp\\\\2026-09-19-qwen\\\\runtime\\\\pelican-bicycle.html\", \"oldString\": \" // 空格键快捷播放/暂停\\n document.addEventListener('keydown', fu\"","kind":"tool-result","attachments":[]}

event: message_replace
data: {"id":"msg-1789828390456-0","author":"qwen(qwen3.8-flash)","role":"assistant","target":"聊天","content":"修改完成并已验证。文件：`C:\\Users\\zhupu\\Desktop\\coolzhuagent\\tmp\\2026-09-19-qwen\\runtime\\pelican-bicycle.html`（现 381 行；鹈鹕轮廓、IK 双腿、180° 相位差、曲柄/脚踏同步、三层视差背景及上一轮的播放/暂停/速度/恢复默认全部原样保留）。\n\n**本轮具体变更：**\n\n1. **低高度布局修复（针对原 `svg{max-height:88vh}` 的实际缺陷）**\n   原来画面按 88vh 缩放，下方控制条（≈40px）+ 间距再加约 54px，在 1024×600（88vh=528+54>600）和 720×480（88vh=422+54>480）下控制条会被推出视口被裁。现改为：\n   - 新增 `:root{--ui:84px}`（控制条总占位），SVG 宽度取 `min(100vw-16px, (100vh-−ui)×1.6)` 并保持 16:10 viewBox 比例 → 画面高度恰好等于 `100vh - 控制条`，任何视口下画面+控制条整体不溢出、不裁切；\n   - `@media (max-height:560px)`（覆盖 720×480）：`--ui` 降到 62px，控制条改小圆角、12px 字号、窄按钮、滑块缩短到 110px；\n   - 控制条加 `flex-wrap:wrap`，720px 宽度下四个控件一行放不下时自动换行而非溢出。\n   验算：720×480 → 画面 664×415，加压缩后控制条约 58px，共 ≈477 < 480 ✓；1024×600 → 画面高度受宽限制为 632→裁到宽 1008，实际高度 516+控制条 64 ≈ 588 < 600 ✓。\n\n2. **“减少动态”选项（新增复选框，位于控制条末位）**\n   - 勾选 = 停止推进虚拟时间轴，所有 SMIL（轮子、双腿、脚掌公转、曲柄、身体起伏、翅膀、喉囊、背景视差、路面/链条虚线）冻结在当前帧；取消勾选 = 从冻结帧无缝续播。\n   - 状态同步：用户点“▶ 播放”或按空格恢复播放时自动取消勾选（显式覆盖）；“↺ 恢复默认”同时清除勾选、倍速回 1.00×、时间轴归零。\n\n3. **prefers-reduced-motion 兼顾**\n   - JS：`matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)')` 命中时初始即勾选并冻结，且监听 `change`（含旧版 `addListener` 回退），系统设置中途改变会实时跟随；\n   - CSS：`@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` 下移除按钮 hover 过渡动画。\n\n上一轮遗留的一个小不一致（空格键恢复播放不复选“减少动态”勾选框）已一并修正，脚本区已复读确认无重复监听。","kind":"assistant-reply","attachments":[]}

